{"time": 1772359864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160371312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有人制造命案，让人误以为诅咒开始了，但其实并没有开始"}
