{"time": 1772361066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496802303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看见，走廊尽头，星野鸫走上楼梯，在窗外看向301的教室里。"}
{"time": 1772437148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274011275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你在校门口目送着她们两人结伴离开。"}
{"time": 1772437169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027107562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此时大雨不歇"}
{"time": 1772437190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649263332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*找个地方先躲躲雨"}
{"time": 1772437265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773069082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在校门口这样的地方，大概只有岗亭可以供人躲雨了。当然门卫也在这里。\"同学?怎么不去上课跑到这里来了?\"他看到你了之后开口"}
{"time": 1772437278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1467804024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*声音低沉"}
{"time": 1772437309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300996255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“学校出了事情，老师意外遇险了，您能过去看看吗，我已经报警想等警察过来”"}
{"time": 1772437422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407958668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不知道为什么突然下这么大的...\"他本来还在自言自语，突然瞪大了眼睛，\"哪个老师?\""}
{"time": 1772437432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400274875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“小林老师”"}
{"time": 1772437439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644287139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“您知道什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1772437625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839355125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "他摇摇头，\"你们是三年一班的学生吧，我这把老骨头就不去看了。\"深深叹了口气，\"今年是从老师开始吗？\""}
{"time": 1772437657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616499736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“谁知道呢？或许在此之前还有我们不知道的人吧”"}
{"time": 1772437838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689958110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "589351221", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*看警察什么时候到了"}
